格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Independent MIT-licensed DeepSeek Harness plugin for FHL Images generation, editing, worker pools, and chat-configured credentials.","id":"gh:1342041991","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"DSH-FHL-Image-Plugin","slug":"supart/DSH-FHL-Image-Plugin","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Independent MIT-licensed DeepSeek Harness plugin for FHL Images generation, editing, worker pools, a"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"nd chat-configured credentials."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH FHL Image 0.2.2"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"中文 · English"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## 中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"### 这是什么"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"`DSH FHL Image` 是一个独立、MIT 许可的 DeepSeek Harness 社区插件，为 DSH\n增加 FHL Images 生图、图片编辑、多参考图和 Worker 池能力。"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"> 这是社区项目，不是官方 DeepSeek 或 FHL 产品，也不是完整的 DSH 软件。\n> 使用前必须先安装并能启动 DSH。"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### 版本对应"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| 插件版本 | 目标 DSH | 状态 |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| `0.2.2` | 官方桌面版 `0.2.0-rc.2` 包线 | 当前版本 |\n| `0.2.1` | 官方桌面版 `0.2.0-rc.2` 包线 | 旧版本 |\n| `0.1.0` | 旧 `"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"0.1.1-rc.1` 包线 | 已不再支持 |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"安装包：`fhl-plugins-dsh-fhl-image-0.2.2.tgz`（Release 附件，或本地\n`pnpm build && pnpm pack` 生成）。`.tgz` 是插件包，*"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"lugins-dsh-fhl-image-0.2.2.tgz`（Release 附件，或本地\n`pnpm build && pnpm pack` 生成）。`.tgz` 是插件包，**不能双击运行**。"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"下载直链："},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### 安装"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"**一条提示词安装（推荐）**"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"在自己的 DSH 会话里直接发送下面这段，Agent 会用插件管理工具下载安装："},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"> ⚠️ **必须用上面这条以 `.tgz` 结尾的下载直链。**\n> 实测插件管理器只把「以 `.tgz` 结尾的 http(s) 直链」「本地绝对路径」「git 源」\n> 「npm 包名」当作可安"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"装来源，而本项目后三种都不可用：\n> 仓库地址或 `.../releases/latest` 会被识别成 **git 源**，但本仓库不含构建产物\n> `lib/`（已被 `.gitignore` 排"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"除）且没有安装期构建脚本，装上去 `main` 指向的文件\n> 不存在，插件无法加载；`@fhl-plugins/dsh-fhl-image` 也未发布到 npm。"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"安装会改写 `desktop` profile 的 `package.json`、`pnpm-lock.yaml` 与\n`node_modules/`，因此需要 `danger-full-access"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ktop` profile 的 `package.json`、`pnpm-lock.yaml` 与\n`node_modules/`，因此需要 `danger-full-access` 权限或当次授权。"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"**图形界面手动安装**"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"1. 把 tarball 放到**不含空格**的目录（如 `~/Downloads/`），进入侧边栏「插件」页面，\n选择安装并填入它的**绝对路径**。\n2. 安装完成后打开该插件的启用开关。\n3. "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"完全退出并重新打开 App。\n4. 新建会话，确认工具列表中有 `fhl_image_configure`、`fhl_image_generate`、\n`fhl_image_edit`。"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"桌面 App 独占管理 `desktop` profile，因此不要从外部 shell 对它执行 `dsh plugin`。"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"**命令行版 DSH（进阶）**"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"完整步骤、验证判据与升级卸载见 安装说明。"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### 已实现的工具"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- `fhl_image_configure`：用户明确要求时配置最多十个 Worker。\n- `fhl_image_generate`：生成一至九张图。\n- `fhl_image_edit`：使用一"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"figure`：用户明确要求时配置最多十个 Worker。\n- `fhl_image_generate`：生成一至九张图。\n- `fhl_image_edit`：使用一至十张有序参考图进行编辑或组合。"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### 聊天配置生图 API"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"新建会话，先确认工具列表中有上面三个工具，然后发送："},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Agent 询问后，把一个或多个 Worker Key 粘贴到聊天框，每个 Key 一行。配置阶段只应\n调用 `fhl_image_configure`，成功后只根据脱敏的 Worker 数量确认配置"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"gent 询问后，把一个或多个 Worker Key 粘贴到聊天框，每个 Key 一行。配置阶段只应\n调用 `fhl_image_configure`，成功后只根据脱敏的 Worker 数量确认配置。"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"聊天配置有一个重要边界：原始 Key 会随用户消息经过当前模型，并可能保留在 DSH 会话\n历史中。不能接受这种传输方式的凭据，应改用 DSH 自身的凭据机制直接写入对应引用名\n（`FHL_IMAGE"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"_API_KEY`、`FHL_IMAGE_API_KEY_2`……）。插件配置项 `apiKeyEnv` 只是这些\n引用名的前缀，**不是环境变量**。不要把 Key 发到 GitHub、Codex "},{"id":"p32s3","text":"GE_API_KEY_2`……）。插件配置项 `apiKeyEnv` 只是这些\n引用名的前缀，**不是环境变量**。不要把 Key 发到 GitHub、Codex 主对话、截图、日志\n或 Issue。"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"### 第一次生图和编辑"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"有参考图时，把图片拖入聊天框："},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"编辑时若省略 `sources`，插件会依次使用：当前用户消息里的图片 → 更早的用户上传\n图片 → 本插件在同一会话、同一进程内生成的最近一张图。重启 App 后第三条记忆会\n失效，此时请显式传入上"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"一次结果中的 `attachmentId`。"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"结果通过 DSH 附件服务回到对话中。"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"### 覆盖插件配置"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"默认值写在 bundle 层里，不读取环境变量。需要修改时，在 profile 补丁层覆盖："},{"id":"p41s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"### GitHub 页面示例图"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"下面两张图来自本项目的实际使用界面："},{"id":"p44s1","text":"### 没有工具怎么办"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"1. 确认插件在「插件」页面已安装且已启用。\n2. 完全退出并重新打开桌面 App（命令行版则停止旧 Host 后重启同一个 profile）。\n3. 新建会话，再检查三个工具。"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"## Version Compatibility"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"| Plugin | Target DSH | Status |"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"| `0.2.2` | Official desktop line `0.2.0-rc.2` | Current |\n| `0.2.1` | Official desktop line `0.2.0-"},{"id":"p49s2","text":"rc.2` | Superseded |\n| `0.1.0` | Legacy `0.1.1-rc.1` line | Unsupported |"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"DSH 0.2 checks every `@deepseek-ai/dsh*` peer range against the running runtime\nbefore installing a "},{"id":"p50s2","text":"bundle and again at startup, so the declared ranges — not\nthe plugin version alone — decide whether "},{"id":"p50s3","text":"installation is accepted."},{"id":"p51s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p52s1","text":"- `fhl_image_generate`: one to nine image variations through the FHL Images API.\n- `fhl_image_edit`:"},{"id":"p52s2","text":" one to ten ordered reference images, with one to four\nindependent edit variations.\n- Up to ten mana"},{"id":"p52s3","text":"ged image workers addressed through the DSH credential provider\nas `FHL_IMAGE_API_KEY` through `FHL_"},{"id":"p52s4","text":"IMAGE_API_KEY_10`.\n- Retryable worker cooldown, per-worker authentication isolation, cancellation,\nb"},{"id":"p52s5","text":"ounded responses, and credential redaction.\n- Durable DSH attachment output so generated images appe"},{"id":"p52s6","text":"ar in the conversation.\n- `fhl_image_configure`: configure one or more workers from a chat message."},{"id":"p53s1","text":"## Scope And Limitations"},{"id":"p54s1","text":"- This is a Host/Cordis bundle and does not ship a custom DSH settings-card UI;\nper-profile configur"},{"id":"p54s2","text":"ation goes through a patch layer.\n- API key configuration is model-mediated chat configuration, or a"},{"id":"p54s3","text":" direct write\ninto the DSH credential store.\n- The plugin does not download or execute arbitrary rem"},{"id":"p54s4","text":"e\ninto the DSH credential store.\n- The plugin does not download or execute arbitrary remote plugins."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
